# CoreEngine agentic rules

- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/agentic/INVENTORY.md](../../docs/agentic/INVENTORY.md) before multi-file engine work.
- **Single-module tasks:** limit implementation reads/edits to one manifest `path` plus `core/interfaces/` and that module’s tests.
- **Do not** refactor unrelated modules, extract interfaces, or change CMake glob structure unless the task says so.
- **Manifest:** bump `docs/agentic/modules/<id>.module.json` semver when `exports` or observable behavior changes.
- **`core.interfaces`:** any version bump must add a `## [version]` section (or dated line under it) in `core/interfaces/CHANGELOG.md` — `check-module-deps.sh` fails if the heading is missing.
- **Verify:** run `./scripts/check-module-deps.sh` when touching modules or manifests (manifests, includes, deps graph, doc links, `core.interfaces` changelog).
- **Semver:** manifest `requires` ranges are not range-satisfied in the checker; patch/minor/major rules in AGENTS.md are convention only. No `run-gamestate-module-tests.sh`; `core.ai_advanced` is manifest-only (not include-enforced).
- **Pilot module for extractions:** `core.math` unless the user chooses another module from the inventory.